  "citation": "Norby R; Oren R; Boden T; Kauwe M D; Kim D; Medlyn B; Riggs J; Tharp M; Walker A; Yang B; Zaehle S (2015): Phase 1 Free Air CO2 Enrichment Model-Data Synthesis (FACE-MDS): Meteorological Data. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/FACE-MDS/MET.01",
